%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b71d7f6f7d77720459e951f4d068c803, type: 3}
  m_Name: D_SilentSentinel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Morsoul.Cutscene::Morsoul.Cutscene.CutsceneData
  id: D_SilentSentinel
  shots:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: "Do you think you can bind me with paper warrants, machine?! Magic is a parasitic tumor! When the mana tides drain, the beastfolk and spirits dissolve\u2014and our ritual is merciful purification!"
    captionSpeaker: Grand Overseer
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Falsehood. Your own private journal proved mana is the planetary circulatory fluid maintaining tectonic stability. Purging it will collapse the crust and extinguish all life.
    captionSpeaker: Golem
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: You're not a doctor curing an infection. You're an arsonist burning down the house because you despise the children living inside it.
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: "You dare lecture me?! Everything we wield is cold First-Age mechanics! Brass conduits, extraction pylons\u2014there is no witchcraft in steel!"
    captionSpeaker: Grand Overseer
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Your staff burns with the exact dark mana signature forged into Saint Althea's bell clapper. Humanity caused the First-Age catastrophe; your entire operation runs on corrupted mana.
    captionSpeaker: Golem
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: You wrapped yourself in First-Age science because you couldn't admit to your own disciples that you're just another warlock drinking stolen power.
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: "It does not matter! The grounding is gone! When the core reaches saturation, the tectonic plates shatter\u2014and we all burn together!"
    captionSpeaker: Grand Overseer
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: 'Your collapse is preventable. The central console holds an emergency stabilization shunt: a conscious analytical soul core can bridge the polarity circuit directly.'
    captionSpeaker: Golem
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: You built your cult on the lie that humanity was weak, Overseer. Three thousand years ago, two humans gave everything to protect this earth. And we are still standing here.
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: (Eliza kicks the Grand Overseer's ceremonial staff over the chasm brink as sirens shriek across the dais.)
    captionSpeaker: 
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 1.8
    waitForInput: 0
    caption: '>> WARNING: PRIMARY GROUND SEVERED

      >> POLARITY INVERSION AT 94%

      >> MANUAL CORE BRIDGING REQUIRED WITHIN 15 SECONDS'
    captionSpeaker: System
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: It requires a conscious mana core to absorb the polarity backlash and lock the seal permanently.
    captionSpeaker: Golem
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: (Eyes wide with terror, seizing the Golem's arm) {PlayerName}, wait... If you absorb that charge, your chassis won't survive the feedback!
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Bypassing neural link. Engaging emergency mechanical breaker. It will hold the inversion... though the sealing frequency remains incomplete.
    captionSpeaker: Golem
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: "By decree of the High Council and the Investigator's Guild, the conspiracy that threatened our realm has been dismantled! Praise be to our keenest minds \u2014 hailed as Asterveil's finest investigators!"
    captionSpeaker: Guildmaster
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: We saved them all, {PlayerName}. The mines are secure, the acolyte is free, and the Council is rewriting the trade laws. The gate holds... but the tremor hasn't stopped.
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: (Gently) Still no memories, huh? Not a single clue about who made you... or who you used to be?
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Diagnostic check complete. Memory banks remain permanently unreadable. I am an automaton of the Investigator's Guild. That is sufficient.
    captionSpeaker: Golem
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: Yeah. I guess it has to be. Come on, partner. Night patrol starts in an hour.
    captionSpeaker: Eliza
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8c889eebdea7e514b99d349204bb85de, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    durationSeconds: 6
    waitForInput: 1
    caption: "Justice was defended, and the realm endured.\nYet beneath the stone faceplate, the past remained an unread book\u2014a faithful sentinel guarding a world whose origins he would never know.\nAnd far below, the sealed Mana Gate slept: safe for now, but never truly still."
    captionSpeaker: 
  nextSceneName: 
  skipToScene: 1
